meta {
  name: 02 Idempotency
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  # Idempotency-Key (ADR 0003)

  An optional `Idempotency-Key` header (1–200 visible ASCII characters, no spaces) makes a retry safe. Keys
  are scoped per user. A retry with a used key returns the stored entries with `Idempotent-Replayed: true`
  and writes nothing; the retry's body is not compared with the original.
}
